## Runtime errors also returned before a crawl exists (UI-121).
err-no-crawl = No crawl is open.
err-not-implemented = This function is not available yet.
err-view-not-found = This view is no longer available.
err-fallback = The operation could not be completed.
err-range-export = This range contains more than 20,000 rows. Use the table export to export the current view.
err-io = A file operation failed.
err-file-not-found = The file was not found: { $path }
